# The sketch adds 5 to the PWM duty every 30 ms, up to 255 and back down. brightness is the
# average forward current over 20 ms, so the rise and the fall can be checked. One sample of
# D9 cannot, because analogWrite on D9 is about 490 Hz.
open
step 10ms
expect @led1 off
expect @led1.brightness < 100uA
step 590ms
expect @led1 lit
expect @led1.brightness > 3mA
expect @led1.brightness < 7mA
step 940ms
expect @led1 lit
expect @led1.brightness > 10mA
step 1470ms
expect @led1 dim
expect @led1.brightness > 100uA
expect @led1.brightness < 2mA
expect no diagnostics
